                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b436a16f-bfc9-3b45-884f-f11aa2eb5353",
                        "entry_id": "5f665ad1-4acb-313c-b1ed-f42b5f1196aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any type of gun, usually a pistol."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d1f1541-2c89-4111-b531-c57acf6f10c6",
                                "sense_id": "b436a16f-bfc9-3b45-884f-f11aa2eb5353",
                                "text": "You're the second guy I've met within hours who seems to think a gat in the hand means a world by the tail."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3acdf597-f29b-4cdf-a023-dbf9e3c6545b",
                                "sense_id": "b436a16f-bfc9-3b45-884f-f11aa2eb5353",
                                "text": "Goin' off on a motherfucker like that\nWith a gat that's pointed at yo ass"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4f66b64-ba2e-4479-826b-ff33b641bbb5",
                                "sense_id": "b436a16f-bfc9-3b45-884f-f11aa2eb5353",
                                "text": "It'll make you drop to your knees 'cause you realize, that a gat'll make any nigga civilized."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a222380f-5459-45cf-a66d-3c0bf07e761f",
                                "sense_id": "b436a16f-bfc9-3b45-884f-f11aa2eb5353",
                                "text": "I never thought it could happen, this rappin' stuff\nI was too used to packin' gats and stuff"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb2bc2d5-94f7-47f9-a6fe-d5ba376ea5d9",
                                "sense_id": "b436a16f-bfc9-3b45-884f-f11aa2eb5353",
                                "text": "Pimp pulled out his gat and let it hang in his hand. His message was clear."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
