                                "sense_id": "9a7413a4-c837-3631-8697-4a69e39f2181",
                                "text": "With a gat that's pointed at yo ass"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8ba9986-e9de-4db9-addb-a1ba7dea186e",
                                "sense_id": "9a7413a4-c837-3631-8697-4a69e39f2181",
                                "text": "It'll make you drop to your knees 'cause you realize, that a gat'll make any nigga civilized."
